OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 8 MAY
OL,4,G2100FSophie Ellis-Bextor's Kitchen
OL,5,     FDisco
OL,6,     GSophie's ready with two hours of
OL,7,     Gfeelgood for the weekend. This
OL,8,     Gweek she celebrates Sir David
OL,9,     GAttenborough's 100th birthday
OL,10,     Gwith a wildlife-themed Disco
OL,11,     GWonderland!
OL,12,G2300FThe Rock Show with Shaun Keaveny
OL,13,     GBruce Dickinson from Iron Maiden
OL,14,     Gjoins Shaun to chat about the
OL,15,     Gband's 50th anniversary and their
OL,16,     Gnew documentary, Burning Ambition.
