OL,4,G0000FRomesh Ranganathan: For the Love
OL,5,     Fof Hip Hop
OL,6,     GRom is joined by RUBII, an artist
OL,7,     Gfrom Birmingham. She selects 3
OL,8,     Gtracks that have influenced her,
OL,9,     Gand a pick from her EP Feeluh.
OL,10,     GPlus, music from 50 Cent, Ben
OL,11,     GDSP, and Ludacris.
OL,12,G0100FTony Blackburn's Sounds of Soul
OL,13,     GTony delivers another super Soul
OL,14,     Gselection with classics from
OL,15,     GBilly Ocean, Shalamar, Gloria
OL,16,     GGaynor, Marvin Gaye, Natalie Cole
OL,17,     G& more. He also celebrates Phil
OL,18,     GBailey's special day.
